{"title": "Solemnity Outfit in Blue", "pageid": 16287, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Solemnity_Outfit_in_Blue", "categories": ["Camp Clothing", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Camp_Rich_H_Blue_Faded.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Camp_Rich_H_Blue_Faded.webp/300px-Camp_Rich_H_Blue_Faded.webp, /w/images/2/26/Camp_Rich_H_Blue_Faded.webp 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Solemnity Outfit in Blue image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Camp_Rich_H_Blue_Faded.webp/300px-Camp_Rich_H_Blue_Faded.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Camp_Rich_H_Blue_Faded.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Solemnity Outfit in Blue</b> is a common <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Clothing#Camp_Clothing\" title=\"Camp Clothing\">Camp Clothing</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>One of master Figaro's collection pieces, this outfit maintains the poise and grace of the wearer. Honestly, it elevates it considerably. Bad poise becomes competent poise. Competent becomes strong. Strong becomes spiffing.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Clothing\" title=\"Camp Clothing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Camp_Clothing_Icon.png/25px-Camp_Clothing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Camp_Clothing_Icon.png/38px-Camp_Clothing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Camp_Clothing_Icon.png/50px-Camp_Clothing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Camp Clothing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Camp_Clothing_Icon.png/25px-Camp_Clothing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Camp_Clothing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Clothing\" title=\"Camp Clothing\">Camp Clothing</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>